# Phase discipline

Follow `docs/roadmap.md` and `docs/final.md`. Do not invent a v2.

| Phase | Focus |
|-------|--------|
| 1–7 | Shipped on `master` |
| Final | Identity, statement rows, row recon, rebuild, hygiene — then **stop** |

**Out of scope forever:** mobile UI, budgeting UI, PDF/OCR, tax, multi-user sync, “AI categorizes everything”, live bank APIs, extra crate splits.

Prefer failing tests and design-doc updates over new product surfaces.
